  Scenario: About Us page displays the main heading  # features/05_aboutus.feature:11
    Given the app is running                         # steps/home_steps.py:81
    And I am on the home page                        # steps/home_steps.py:85
    When I navigate to "About Us"                    # steps/navigation_steps.py:71
    Then the About Us main heading should be visible # steps/aboutus_steps.py:7

  Scenario: About Us page displays all section headings   # features/05_aboutus.feature:14
    Given the app is running                              # steps/home_steps.py:81
    And I am on the home page                             # steps/home_steps.py:85
